WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:25.710 --> 00:27.220
OH OH OH!

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:03.880 --> 01:05.380
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:04.250 --> 01:07.010
OH! The time has come

01:04.790 --> 01:05.380
BUSTERZ!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.060
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.680 --> 02:48.720
We finally meet again, guys!

02:48.920 --> 02:52.310
It's me, Ieyasu Tokugawa aka Ryogen!

02:52.480 --> 02:54.840
While I'm bored in my Edo castle...

02:55.000 --> 02:59.560
all kinds of things are
happening in the west!

03:00.360 --> 03:03.800
I am disgusted that I have been sidelined!

03:05.000 --> 03:12.880
What angers me the most is that the beautiful Yume
arrived and Yasha didn't even introduce her to me.

03:13.040 --> 03:17.160
If I have to marry a sorceress of the Moon,

03:17.360 --> 03:21.190
I'd prefer the sweet Yume
instead of the rowdy Kaguya.

03:21.360 --> 03:27.670
I heard that Yume has been kidnapped
by that dirty traitor Kobayakawa.

03:28.560 --> 03:33.400
He holds her hostage to force
Musashi and Sanada to compete.

03:33.600 --> 03:37.150
Whoever wins is none of my business!

03:37.960 --> 03:39.710
What is going to happen?

03:40.720 --> 03:42.630
What is going to happen?

03:47.010 --> 03:51.880
Battle For The Castle

04:03.200 --> 04:06.750
The castle is a little run down,
but it is not bad at all.

04:07.640 --> 04:13.270
Apparently it is designed to repel intruders.

04:14.360 --> 04:16.030
It will be hard.

04:17.920 --> 04:21.640
The harder the castle is to conquer,
the more it deserves to be conquered.

04:30.960 --> 04:35.240
How awful, I've sunk as low
as having to conquer a castle.

04:35.400 --> 04:37.710
Lord Yukimura, you shouldn't!

04:37.880 --> 04:40.550
Don't stoop to the level of a thief!

04:40.720 --> 04:44.160
Let us subordinates take
care of situations like that!

04:44.320 --> 04:45.590
He is right.

04:45.760 --> 04:49.590
The three of us will be more
than enough to beat them.

04:49.760 --> 04:51.830
Please stay on the sidelines.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.240
You fool!

04:55.280 --> 04:58.720
Our opponent is Musashi,
a professional thief!

04:59.360 --> 05:06.720
In any case, we must bring Princess Kaguya
and Yume to Lord Ishida Mitsunari.

05:07.120 --> 05:08.390
Understood.

05:10.240 --> 05:18.200
But I wonder why this inept Kobayakawa
is using the princesses to make us fight.

05:40.760 --> 05:42.010
Yume!

05:42.160 --> 05:43.490
Yume, hang in there!

05:43.560 --> 05:44.910
She's fine.

05:45.680 --> 05:48.070
She will wake up soon.

05:54.280 --> 05:56.270
Hideaki Kobayakawa.

05:56.440 --> 05:58.750
What kind of game is this?

05:59.600 --> 06:03.760
Princess Kaguya, Yume,
please forgive me!

06:05.800 --> 06:09.790
I won't be easy but hold on for a little longer!

06:10.240 --> 06:11.470
Hold on for what?

06:12.080 --> 06:13.880
Let that man come!

06:14.400 --> 06:15.440
What man?

06:16.480 --> 06:19.710
Musashi Miyamoto will save you!

06:19.880 --> 06:22.190
Please wait!

06:22.960 --> 06:31.030
So you kidnapped us knowing that
Musashi would come to our rescue?

06:31.560 --> 06:32.990
That's correct.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.670
But why?

06:34.880 --> 06:36.550
You will know soon enough.

06:42.320 --> 06:43.590
Yume!

06:53.200 --> 06:54.480
Princess Kaguya!

06:54.880 --> 06:58.030
This is Ishida Mitsunari's castle.

06:58.200 --> 07:00.760
This is where I was held captive.

07:00.920 --> 07:03.120
I'm back to square one.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.030
Don't worry.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.760
I'm not worried.

07:08.800 --> 07:12.240
Musashi will save us, right?

07:13.240 --> 07:14.440
Like your dream.

07:15.520 --> 07:18.640
Musashi is already in this castle.

07:19.520 --> 07:22.880
Moonlight and Ruko told me.

07:44.800 --> 07:47.390
Ronin, don't lift your foot.

07:58.760 --> 08:00.010
Go ahead!

08:15.680 --> 08:17.000
That was close.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.430
Be careful!

08:18.600 --> 08:22.150
I let my guard down, but this castle...

08:22.680 --> 08:26.830
It's full of traps for ninjas.

08:27.000 --> 08:28.590
It seems very fun!

08:44.960 --> 08:47.030
I'm not so easy to catch!

09:06.760 --> 09:07.980
That's too easy!

09:39.560 --> 09:40.630
Lord Yukimura!

09:40.840 --> 09:42.400
Hurry, now!

09:46.880 --> 09:48.130
Nyudo!

09:48.560 --> 09:51.550
Don't worry about me,
go on ahead, Lord Yukimura!

09:52.160 --> 09:53.590
Go ahead!

09:57.080 --> 09:58.040
Lord Yukimura!

09:58.880 --> 10:02.080
Don't worry about Miyoshi!
Hurry!

10:05.320 --> 10:06.990
Jimpachi, I'm counting on you!

10:37.440 --> 10:38.610
Yasha!

10:46.880 --> 10:48.110
Dammit!

10:48.360 --> 10:49.350
Yasha!

10:50.320 --> 10:52.630
Forgive me.
What is it?

10:53.360 --> 10:55.320
Do you have anything good to propose?

10:55.480 --> 10:56.880
I'm bored out of my mind!

10:59.880 --> 11:03.430
You should enjoy the rest of the events.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.880
What do you mean?

11:08.040 --> 11:09.470
I don't know exactly...

11:09.640 --> 11:14.080
but I will have to see
the results for myself.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.350
Wait!

11:16.240 --> 11:17.990
- Are you leaving?
- Yes.

11:18.160 --> 11:21.600
Yasha, don't leave on your own, it's not fair!

11:21.760 --> 11:23.960
I want to have fun too!

11:26.280 --> 11:27.190
May I?

11:28.440 --> 11:35.750
Forgive me, I'd like for you to come,
but if anything bad were to happen...

11:36.120 --> 11:38.950
All right, I understand!

11:39.120 --> 11:41.680
But bring me back a gift, okay?

11:41.840 --> 11:43.400
Very well.

11:56.080 --> 11:59.120
It's just a decoration, it scared me.

12:09.960 --> 12:11.070
What?

12:20.280 --> 12:23.320
Wood and mechanisms?
Is it a mechanical puppet?

12:25.240 --> 12:26.560
Flammable bullets!

12:39.440 --> 12:43.350
The demon gun...
The supreme legendary gun.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.800
What was that thing?

12:48.280 --> 12:52.640
Only one person in the country knows
how to build these mechanical puppets.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.820
I know.

12:55.200 --> 12:59.190
Old Dabinoji must have
made that for the shogunate.

12:59.840 --> 13:04.360
Makes sense, this is Ishida Mitsunari's castle.

13:04.960 --> 13:07.110
The old man really has no principles.

13:07.680 --> 13:09.400
Come on, let's move.

13:10.040 --> 13:11.210
Yeah!

13:16.640 --> 13:19.330
- I have a bad feeling about this.
- So do I!

13:28.680 --> 13:31.440
- I was right.
- Yes!

13:40.320 --> 13:44.200
I have no time to waste on wooden people!

13:44.360 --> 13:45.470
Yeah!

13:50.840 --> 13:52.790
Damn, there are still more of them!

13:52.840 --> 13:54.010
Yeah!

14:01.440 --> 14:04.040
Lord Yukimura, leave them to me!

14:04.280 --> 14:06.320
- Go ahead!
- But...

14:06.480 --> 14:11.400
Jimpachi Nezu and Seikai Miyoshi...

14:12.120 --> 14:17.760
are already trapped by the castle!

14:20.720 --> 14:25.950
We must win this
competition for them as well!

14:32.960 --> 14:35.520
Lord Yukimura, hurry!
Go ahead!

14:36.280 --> 14:37.630
Thank you, Saizo!

14:43.040 --> 14:45.400
Musashi, there is no time to waste!

14:45.560 --> 14:47.710
I'm not losing this!

14:51.280 --> 14:53.750
Damn, if we keep fighting them...

14:53.920 --> 14:56.510
Yukimura Sanada is gonna get there first!

15:03.320 --> 15:04.920
Musashi Miyamoto?

15:05.280 --> 15:06.600
That's me!

15:06.760 --> 15:09.430
This is the shortest way to the top!

15:10.800 --> 15:13.790
What are you doing?
Do you want Yukimura Sanada to win?

15:14.440 --> 15:16.000
No, never!

15:16.600 --> 15:17.830
Wait, Musashi!

15:18.440 --> 15:19.660
What?

15:19.720 --> 15:22.080
We don't even know who he is!

15:22.240 --> 15:24.200
We don't have time for that!

15:27.320 --> 15:28.970
Ronin, jump up too!

15:35.840 --> 15:37.120
How shameful...

15:37.360 --> 15:39.000
What is the meaning of this?

15:39.160 --> 15:40.400
Ronin is downstairs!

15:40.880 --> 15:44.480
Yume asked Musashi Miyamoto for help.

15:44.920 --> 15:46.200
What?

15:47.200 --> 15:50.990
The top is above us, go save Yume!

15:51.680 --> 15:53.110
Who are you?

15:53.280 --> 15:56.430
Hideaki Kobayakawa, lord of Bizen Castle.

15:57.000 --> 16:03.150
Is it normal for the organizer of a
competition to favor one of the participants?

16:04.000 --> 16:06.590
Yukimura Sanada is just a
dog of the shogunate now!

16:06.760 --> 16:08.720
He must not prevail.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.720
What a bizarre story.

16:12.600 --> 16:15.750
We can talk about it after you save Yume.

16:15.920 --> 16:17.400
Now, hurry up!

16:28.120 --> 16:29.630
The top is right there!

16:31.920 --> 16:33.350
Are you coming?

16:33.840 --> 16:35.910
How many times do I have to repeat?

16:36.080 --> 16:40.070
It's you, Musashi Miyamoto,
who should save Yume!

16:40.640 --> 16:41.880
I got it!

16:45.960 --> 16:48.570
- By the way, Musashi.
- What is it?

16:49.320 --> 16:52.440
Do you have the legendary demon gun with you?

16:52.880 --> 16:54.150
You know a lot...

16:54.960 --> 16:56.760
Yume is the one who told me that.

16:57.280 --> 17:00.320
She saw in her dreams...

17:00.480 --> 17:02.030
all of your feats...

17:02.160 --> 17:04.600
and she told me everything.

17:05.000 --> 17:07.800
No anti-ayakashi weapon worked.

17:07.960 --> 17:11.240
That ayakashi spider was really powerful.

17:11.960 --> 17:13.280
But Musashi...

17:13.440 --> 17:17.040
he got the legendary demon gun from Master Takuan.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.960
The demon gun?

17:19.160 --> 17:19.960
Incredible!

17:21.320 --> 17:23.440
What a strange story...

17:23.600 --> 17:25.320
Where is this demon gun?

17:26.160 --> 17:27.590
Right here.

17:29.000 --> 17:30.200
Really?

17:42.080 --> 17:43.590
I got you, Musashi!

17:45.080 --> 17:46.350
Musashi!

17:47.760 --> 17:49.110
Thank you.

17:55.040 --> 17:58.640
Forgive me, but I'm borrowing you gun!

17:59.200 --> 18:02.800
So the demon gun is what you were after.

18:03.280 --> 18:09.600
Exactly! But don't worry, I'll return it
to you as soon as I beat those guys!

18:09.760 --> 18:11.080
What guys?

18:11.240 --> 18:16.440
The shogunate guys, Ishida and his henchmen!

18:17.040 --> 18:20.830
Stop! Whoever uses the
gun becomes a demon!

18:21.000 --> 18:22.070
Drop it right now!

18:22.720 --> 18:25.920
Nonsense!
Why are you not a demon?

18:26.480 --> 18:27.630
Stop!

18:28.520 --> 18:35.200
I agree to become a demon if I can take
revenge on those who betrayed me!

18:41.400 --> 18:42.960
I warned you!

18:59.720 --> 19:01.070
Where am I?

19:05.360 --> 19:06.110
Who's there?

19:23.760 --> 19:25.320
Is that you, the demon?

19:25.800 --> 19:29.710
Are you after the gun, too?

19:32.000 --> 19:35.630
Try to kill me then!

19:38.520 --> 19:41.480
Become a demon!

19:42.880 --> 19:43.990
What?

20:06.400 --> 20:09.790
Such is the power of the gun!

20:10.560 --> 20:14.760
Bullets tear open human skin,

20:14.920 --> 20:17.590
bite deep into the flesh,

20:17.760 --> 20:19.800
and shred through the organs.

20:20.560 --> 20:25.080
The terror of what it
means to pull the trigger...

20:25.760 --> 20:31.950
People use guns without knowing that.

20:33.800 --> 20:39.510
Such people will all become demons.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.990
Are you ok?

21:15.920 --> 21:17.140
How do you feel?

21:28.240 --> 21:30.200
That's not possible, you have become...

21:31.960 --> 21:35.640
Musashi Miyamoto, I'm borrowing the gun!

21:37.280 --> 21:42.040
With this, I will slaughter all of
the members of the shogunate!

21:42.560 --> 21:43.690
Demon...

21:44.000 --> 21:48.920
I will start with Yukimura Sanada,
the dog of the shogunate!

22:02.880 --> 22:04.280
Lord Kobayakawa!

22:05.040 --> 22:08.000
I doubt he can be trusted.

22:09.040 --> 22:10.280
Look at his shadow.

22:12.760 --> 22:13.800
Horns!

22:13.960 --> 22:18.630
Kobayakawa has succumbed to the gun demon.

22:18.800 --> 22:19.920
That can't be!

22:20.040 --> 22:23.000
Don't be afraid, I will not kill you.

22:26.880 --> 22:28.950
Kobayakawa, Musashi is not here?

22:29.440 --> 22:31.950
Congratulations, Yukimura Sanada.

22:32.120 --> 22:33.440
You are the first.

22:34.080 --> 22:40.160
Then honor your promise and
release Kaguya and Yume.

22:40.600 --> 22:42.080
It's impossible.

22:42.600 --> 22:44.000
What?

22:44.160 --> 22:48.360
You were supposed to hand
them over to whoever won!

22:56.000 --> 22:59.280
It's impossible, because you will die here.

22:59.920 --> 23:02.230
Is that the demon gun?

23:08.800 --> 23:12.400
Stop it, Lord Kobayakawa!
I beg of you!

23:12.760 --> 23:15.150
Hideaki Kobayakawa,
don't do anything crazy!

23:28.520 --> 23:30.000
Watch out!

23:30.480 --> 23:31.700
No!

23:42.480 --> 23:44.430
How is that possible?

23:45.360 --> 23:47.160
Did Yume do that?

23:57.450 --> 24:00.200
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:00.200 --> 24:03.040
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:03.040 --> 24:08.380
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:08.380 --> 24:13.510
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:15.050 --> 24:20.180
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:20.180 --> 24:26.360
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:26.360 --> 24:31.690
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:31.690 --> 24:35.820
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:38.200 --> 24:48.590
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:48.590 --> 24:59.510
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

24:59.510 --> 25:02.270
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:02.270 --> 25:05.140
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:05.140 --> 25:10.730
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:10.730 --> 25:13.490
I'll bring out every part

25:13.490 --> 25:16.490
of your unchanging style

25:16.490 --> 25:21.790
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:21.790 --> 25:26.960
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:27.360 --> 25:28.710
Dabinoji!

25:28.920 --> 25:30.190
Been a while!

25:30.920 --> 25:33.230
But why are you being friendly with Yasha?

25:33.440 --> 25:38.030
What? Sasuke Sarutobi,
he's a monkey, right?

25:38.200 --> 25:41.670
The next chapter: <i>Sasuke	Sarutobi</i>!
